WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:02.840
Imagine that you could buy stocks from your uncle’s farm.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:08.910
Yes, let’s assume that your uncle has a
farm, a small farm, with some cows, and you

00:00:08.910 --> 00:00:16.090
can buy stocks from his company.

00:00:16.090 --> 00:00:20.099
On the stock market, just like you would do
with big companies like Apple, Exxon or Chevron.

00:00:20.099 --> 00:00:21.099
Do you think I’m crazy?

00:00:21.099 --> 00:00:22.099
Not at all!

00:00:22.099 --> 00:00:28.330
At the end of this video, you will see where
I’m coming from.

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:35.460
Imagine that you wanna start a company.

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:36.690
A traditional company.

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:41.430
Let’s stick to the example of the cows farm
to produce milk and Dairy products.

00:00:41.430 --> 00:00:44.150
What is the first thing you need?

00:00:44.150 --> 00:00:45.550
Of course, money!

00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:54.090
You need money to buy the property, the facilities
and the cows.

00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.600
Where can you get that funding?

00:00:55.600 --> 00:00:58.690
The first option would be, of course, the
bank.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:01.120
But this has many issues.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:05.110
The first one is that, if it was not risky
enough to start your own company, having a

00:01:05.110 --> 00:01:07.180
loan makes it even more risky.

00:01:07.180 --> 00:01:10.100
You can end up bankrupt and with debts.

00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:13.220
Besides, the person in the bank might not
want to give you that loan.

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:17.110
If you have ever tried to get a loan to start
a company, you know what I’m talking about!

00:01:17.110 --> 00:01:20.450
It is pretty hard to convince a banker to
lend you money.

00:01:20.450 --> 00:01:24.079
So we discard the bank option.

00:01:24.079 --> 00:01:26.560
The next alternative is a venture capitalist.

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:28.899
You know, one of those guys in Silicon Valley.

00:01:28.899 --> 00:01:33.680
People with lots of cash and willingness to
invest in young talents like you.

00:01:33.680 --> 00:01:34.680
Who knows!

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:38.840
Maybe your small farm might become the nigh
industry behemoth!

00:01:38.840 --> 00:01:40.180
But…

00:01:40.180 --> 00:01:45.210
OK, do you know any of those venture capitalist?

00:01:45.210 --> 00:01:46.210
Chances are you don’t.

00:01:46.210 --> 00:01:48.079
Specially if you live somewhere in the middle
of India.

00:01:48.079 --> 00:01:50.080
OK, so no Banks, no venture capitalists…

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:51.780
Are your parents Rich?

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:52.780
No?

00:01:52.780 --> 00:01:55.049
OK, so your parents cannot help you either…

00:01:55.049 --> 00:01:56.310
Hum… wait a minute!

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:01.420
I think I have an idea… what if you could
enter the stock market?

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:09.390
Yes, you know, something like Wall Street,
where General Motors or McDonalds are…

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:13.420
The good thing about the stock market is that
you don’t need to know a millionaire to

00:02:13.420 --> 00:02:14.520
get funds.

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:18.560
There are thousands of small investors out
there who buy stocks every day.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:22.270
So let’s say that you divide your company
in, say, 10,000 stocks.

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:25.120
Each of them have an initial price of 10 bucks.

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:28.370
And people, no matter where do they live,
can buy those.

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:32.870
Maybe there is a guy in Kansas who buys one
stock.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:35.390
And there is a woman in France who buys 10.

00:02:35.390 --> 00:02:40.070
This way, with no contacts and no bankers,
you can get the funding you need.

00:02:40.070 --> 00:02:43.870
You just need a good idea and hard work, right?

00:02:43.870 --> 00:02:46.780
Well, don’t get too excited.

00:02:46.780 --> 00:02:49.700
There is a big problema.

00:02:49.700 --> 00:02:54.120
For instance, if you want to get in the New
York stock exchange, your company should have

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:58.230
already made, at least, 10 million dollars
in the last 3 years.

00:02:58.230 --> 00:02:59.560
And this is just the beginning.

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:03.120
There are lots and lots of regulations that
you should meet.

00:03:03.120 --> 00:03:04.120
Well…

00:03:04.120 --> 00:03:06.951
THIS is the situation where the guys from
the Khokholskaya Agricultural Company were.

00:03:06.951 --> 00:03:11.650
They lived in Russia, they wanted to start
a cow farm and they had no money…

00:03:11.650 --> 00:03:12.800
What do you think they did?

00:03:12.800 --> 00:03:15.770
Well… check this out!

00:03:15.770 --> 00:03:23.050
Russian-based Khokholskaya Agricultural Company
plans to launch an ICO named MilkCoin to fund

00:03:23.050 --> 00:03:24.050
a dairy farm.

00:03:24.050 --> 00:03:25.080
Yes, you heard this right!

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.110
This farmers launched their own cryptocurrency!

00:03:27.110 --> 00:03:29.940
This is something like their own version of
Bitcoin.

00:03:29.940 --> 00:03:34.220
They advertised it on their own website and
they launched the offer of this new coins.

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:37.940
This is what we call an Initial Coin Offering
or ICO.

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:39.580
And now you might wonder… but…

00:03:39.580 --> 00:03:41.980
Why should I buy ANOTHER cryptocurrency?

00:03:41.980 --> 00:03:43.370
Isn’t it enough with bitCoin?

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:45.890
Well… you might think you are just buying
coins.

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:50.080
But in fact, you are buying stocks.

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:52.190
Without going through the tradicional stock
markets.

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.450
At the end of this video, I will tell you
what happened finally with this company.

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:59.480
But the truth is… they are not the only
example…

00:03:59.480 --> 00:04:08.130
Only 48% of ICOs were successful last year
— but startups still managed to raise $5.6

00:04:08.130 --> 00:04:09.130
billion

00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:13.740
Yes, my dear viewers, there is already a brand
new way of making Money to start a company.

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:16.320
And it is available for everybody.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:19.299
But wait a minute because not everything is
so beautiful!

00:04:19.299 --> 00:04:22.270
As you can imagine, this idea of the ICOs
seems like a scammer’s paradise.

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:27.600
So the question is… can we really trust
this brand new way of starting companies?

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:30.290
And what does Switzerland have to do with
all of this?

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:35.100
Today we are going to answer all of this questions
but, before we do, let’s take a look back

00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:38.410
at the history.

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:40.180
COINS VS TOKENS

00:04:40.180 --> 00:04:44.720
In the year 2013, all the tech industry was
already pretty aware of BITCOIN.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:49.540
In Silicon Valley they were celebrating all
kinds of events and talks about the future

00:04:49.540 --> 00:04:53.970
of this currency.

00:04:53.970 --> 00:04:57.380
In one of them, there was a man called J.R.
WILLET.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.180
This man had a very funny idea.

00:04:59.180 --> 00:05:04.000
He said we could create other alternative
currencies that, using the same tech as Bitcoin,

00:05:04.000 --> 00:05:05.460
would have different rules.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.190
And how are we supposed to pay to the IT people
who would design all of that?

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.560
They asked him.

00:05:09.560 --> 00:05:13.851
He said that, instead of looking for a venture
capitalist, he could sell some notes, what

00:05:13.851 --> 00:05:18.850
we call a TOKEN, that would be exchange for
the coins once they are created.

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:24.650
And this is how the first Initial Coin Offering
was created.

00:05:24.650 --> 00:05:27.730
But before we continue, we must make a parenthesis.

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:29.320
Many of you might wonder…

00:05:29.320 --> 00:05:30.950
What is a TOKEN?

00:05:30.950 --> 00:05:31.950
Well…

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:35.590
Tokens are any kind of element that can be
changed in a blockchain.

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:37.340
Cryptocurrencies are one kind of token.

00:05:37.340 --> 00:05:38.520
But there are many more.

00:05:38.520 --> 00:05:41.770
On one hand, we have those that give a right
to its owner.

00:05:41.770 --> 00:05:44.280
For instance, this would be the example of
those notes that you could change by brand

00:05:44.280 --> 00:05:50.030
new currencies once they are created.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.500
On the other hand, we have the tokens that
are based on an asset.

00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.500
This would be the case of the stocks from
the Russian farmers.

00:05:56.500 --> 00:06:00.560
Having one of their tokens equals to have
a share of their company.

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:04.889
This Initial Public Offering of Tokens became
in fashion in the year 2014.

00:06:04.889 --> 00:06:05.900
Why?

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:08.400
What happened in 2014?

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:14.590
Well that was the year when the second most
famous cryptocurrency was created.

00:06:14.590 --> 00:06:21.130
Ethereum: the decentralised platform that
might displace today’s institutions

00:06:21.130 --> 00:06:24.850
Unlike Bitcoin, we all know who is behind
Ethereum.

00:06:24.850 --> 00:06:28.010
This is a company that offers way more than
a cryptocurrency.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:32.900
They also offer a system so other people can
create their own cryptocurrencies and tokens.

00:06:32.900 --> 00:06:37.670
For example, do you remember this other video
where I told you how a Spanish bank is using

00:06:37.670 --> 00:06:39.880
blockchain to give corporate loans?

00:06:39.880 --> 00:06:40.880
So well…

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:42.560
Ethereum is the platform they use.

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:45.340
And we are not talking only about Spanish
banks!

00:06:45.340 --> 00:06:50.010
Ethereum has made it really easy to lots of
people to start creating different financial

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.740
products on blockchain.

00:06:52.740 --> 00:07:00.370
The Ethereum rush has been unleashed: ICOs
are on fashion in the tech investment world

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:03.760
Since then, lots of companies are getting
finance this way.

00:07:03.760 --> 00:07:08.430
For example, SIRINLABS is a Swiss company
that is about to launch their own smartphone.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:14.130
This company has gotten more than 118 million
bucks thanks to one of the most successful

00:07:14.130 --> 00:07:15.130
ICOs of history.

00:07:15.130 --> 00:07:20.620
And, of course, there are all kinds of Internet
companies that have been born with this system.

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.920
But hold on just a second because not everything
is so beautiful!

00:07:23.920 --> 00:07:27.590
ICOs have no regulation whatsoever.

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:30.630
So you can imagine the rest.

00:07:30.630 --> 00:07:36.460
How to create an ICO Scam in 5 simple steps

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:40.240
So now you might wonder… what is the difference
between and ICO and, for example, a website

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.970
like Kickstarter?

00:07:41.970 --> 00:07:43.440
Easy!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:47.860
If you support some Kickstarter project, you
cannot sell any share.

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:53.831
On an ICO, you can buy a token or a coin and,
if it goes higher on the market value, sell

00:07:53.831 --> 00:07:57.060
it to another investor.

00:07:57.060 --> 00:08:05.530
The only problem is that here, there is no
financial police or SEC that running against

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:06.530
the bag guys.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:11.040
So imagine how many people thought they would
get rich in a matter of months and they lost

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:16.080
tons of money, instead.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:20.560
For example, SAVEDROID was a German company
who wanted to make a cryptocurrency based

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.590
credit card.

00:08:21.590 --> 00:08:25.120
It had all the buzzwords to make speculators
happy.

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:28.260
Everything seemed beautiful, technological
and disruptive.

00:08:28.260 --> 00:08:29.500
Specially disruptive.

00:08:29.500 --> 00:08:31.360
They got 50 million dollars to launch it.

00:08:31.360 --> 00:08:32.360
And once they got them…

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:33.610
what do you think it happened?

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:34.640
Well, they just disappeared.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:40.490
And since there was not public register whatsoever,
it is almost impossible to find the owner.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:48.570
I’m sure all of you have already seen lots
of ads about tokens, coins and lots of things

00:08:48.570 --> 00:08:50.790
that promise a lot of profit.

00:08:50.790 --> 00:08:55.270
For a better understanding, even the CEO of
Ethereum, VITALIK BUTERIN, recognized that

00:08:55.270 --> 00:08:57.420
most of the ICOs are scams.

00:08:57.420 --> 00:09:00.510
As you can imagine, governments have already
started to act.

00:09:00.510 --> 00:09:02.210
China has banned ICOs.

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.730
America seems to follow a similar way.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:10.000
Other countries like Estonia said that it’s
OK to invest in ICOs for everyone except by

00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:11.000
EStonian citizens.

00:09:11.000 --> 00:09:12.040
This is something like…

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:16.760
‘Oh, yeah man, you can scam whoever you
want but not my people!’.

00:09:16.760 --> 00:09:20.200
Nonetheless there is ONE country that has
found an intermediate solution.

00:09:20.200 --> 00:09:25.170
They will not ban it but they will not let
it go as it is today.

00:09:25.170 --> 00:09:26.410
Which country am I talking about?

00:09:26.410 --> 00:09:27.410
Here is a clue!

00:09:27.410 --> 00:09:30.810
We talked about it in one of the most viewed
videos here at VisualPolitik.

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:32.660
Do you already know it?

00:09:32.660 --> 00:09:38.170
Of course, we are talking about…

00:09:38.170 --> 00:09:43.350
SWITZERLAND, THE CRYPTO NATION

00:09:43.350 --> 00:09:45.320
Do you remember that video we made about Switzerland?

00:09:45.320 --> 00:09:52.330
There we talked about a canton called ZUG,
which has the lowest taxes in the country.

00:09:52.330 --> 00:09:56.210
So… guess where Ethereum has its headquarters!

00:09:56.210 --> 00:10:00.380
Having the biggest crypto currency company
in your country means that you also have the

00:10:00.380 --> 00:10:02.450
biggest experts on the matter.

00:10:02.450 --> 00:10:05.790
So most the of ICOs are done in Swiss servers.

00:10:05.790 --> 00:10:09.680
And, of course, the Swiss Government soon
realized that, with or without scams, this

00:10:09.680 --> 00:10:14.560
was a millionaire industry.

00:10:14.560 --> 00:10:18.990
Switzerland Wants to Be the World Capital
of Cryptocurrency

00:10:18.990 --> 00:10:24.020
Four of the 10 biggest initial coin offerings
last year were in Switzerland, more than any

00:10:24.020 --> 00:10:25.020
other country

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:31.300
This is why, some Swiss municipalities let
their citizens pay taxes or even fines with

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:32.300
cryptocurrencies.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:37.730
Zug, having less than 30,000 inhabitants,
is already the home for 400 blockchain based

00:10:37.730 --> 00:10:38.730
companies.

00:10:38.730 --> 00:10:42.370
And their regional government is already doing
trials to use this technology to organize

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:43.540
the referendums.

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:48.930
You already know that referendums and direct
democracy are essential in the Swiss political

00:10:48.930 --> 00:10:49.930
system.

00:10:49.930 --> 00:10:51.640
So well… now they wanna do them with blockchain.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:59.460
And, of course, Switzerland wants to become
the pioneer in ICO regulations too.

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:03.730
Swiss Financial Authority Releases ICO-Specific
Regulatory Guidelines

00:11:03.730 --> 00:11:07.850
For example, any company who wants to make
an ICO in Switzerland, will have to do it

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:09.350
with a Swiss company.

00:11:09.350 --> 00:11:13.029
This means they will have to register, give
their name and have a physical address.

00:11:13.029 --> 00:11:17.420
This way, it will be easier to chase terrorist,
narcos or scammers.

00:11:17.420 --> 00:11:20.560
As you can imagine, this regulations are starting
to work.

00:11:20.560 --> 00:11:25.480
And many companies have already gone to other
tax havens like CAIMAN islands, that offer

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:34.680
a complete dog-eat-dog scenario where you
can do whatever you want.

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:38.880
This is the short term price you have to pay
in order to have a stable environment.

00:11:38.880 --> 00:11:44.310
We are talking about a world that still needs
a lot to become a mature market.

00:11:44.310 --> 00:11:46.990
But it has plenty of possibilities.

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:50.650
Many more than scams, money laundering or
easy money.

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:53.730
So the Swiss way seems to be the smartest
so far.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:58.310
Yes, a new technology has come: it is risky
but it has many possibilities too.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:03.459
Instead of banning it or, let it completely
free, the best is to regulate it.

00:12:03.459 --> 00:12:05.760
This way we take the good and avoid the bad
part.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:10.680
By the way, going back to our Russian friends…
those who wanted to finance their farm with

00:12:10.680 --> 00:12:11.680
cryptocurrency… well…

00:12:11.680 --> 00:12:16.670
I have bad news for you.

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.800
Unfortunately, since MilkCoin raised only
2% of the Softcap, we are giving back all

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.090
funds that we received.

00:12:22.090 --> 00:12:25.160
We will start the return on the 21st of November.

00:12:25.160 --> 00:12:26.970
Huge thanks to our backers!

00:12:26.970 --> 00:12:27.970
Now the question is…

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:30.760
Do you think other countries will follow the
Swiss example?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:35.560
It is clear that we still need more time for
the ICO market to grow and become mature but…

00:12:35.560 --> 00:12:40.470
Do you think it can be that capitalist revolution
that will open the entry barriers to start

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:41.470
a company?

